// EventKind What an event says changed. Skip kinds you don't know.
type EventKind string

// EventMessage A hint that something changed. It carries IDs and counts only;
// clients refetch through the API. Each kind maps to one cache
// operation. Hints of many changes come at most about once a second.
// Documented kinds and their fields:
//
//   - `workChanged` (`workId`): one work's detail changed, such as after
//     Fix match or a metadata refresh.
//   - `libraryChanged` (`libraryIds`): root works were added to or removed
//     from these libraries (found by a scan, matched, unmatched, moved,
//     gone or purged), one was created or edited, or one is
//     being deleted. It names only
//     libraries the profile sees and comes at most about once every
//     3 seconds. Refetch Home, the library list and its counts, and any
//     open grid, list, filter or letter rail of those libraries, keeping
//     the viewer's place in a grid.
//   - `userStateChanged` (`workIds`): the user's state for these works
//     changed, possibly on another client: marked played or unplayed
//     (a series or season with its episodes), or a play's last
//     position. Refetch them, and the lists that show them.
//   - `playEnded` (`playId`, `message`): the user's play was stopped
//     by an admin or another client, or expired; `message` is the
//     admin's words to the viewer, if any.
//   - `homeChanged`: the user's Home layout changed;
//     every client of the user gets it, the one that made the change
//     too. Refetch Home and the layout.
//   - `listsChanged`: the user's lists changed: one was created,
//     renamed or deleted, or a work was added or removed. Refetch the
//     lists, any open list, Home, the layout and any open work page.
//   - `downloadsChanged`: the user's downloads on the server moved:
//     into line or preparation, along in their preparation (at most
//     every 10 seconds), or to ready or failed. Refetch the downloads that aren't ready.
//   - `tasksChanged`: admins only. A task's work moved: an item started
//     or finished, or reported its progress, a run began or ended, or
//     something was asked for. Refetch the tasks and libraries, whose
//     `scan` says how a scan is going, and the missing files.
//   - `playsChanged`: admins only. A play started or ended, or a
//     heartbeat reported its position; refetch the plays and the play
//     events.
//   - `problemsChanged` (`problemCount`): admins only. The open problems
//     changed; refetch them.
//   - `logsChanged`: admins only. The server logged lines at Info or
//     above; refetch the recent log.
//   - `activityChanged`: admins only. An event was recorded; refetch
//     the activity.
type EventMessage struct {
	// Kind What an event says changed. Skip kinds you don't know.
	Kind       EventKind `json:"kind"`
	LibraryIds *[]ID     `json:"libraryIds,omitempty"`
	Message    *string   `json:"message,omitempty"`

	// PlayID A UUIDv7.
	PlayID       *ID              `json:"playId,omitempty"`
	ProblemCount *int             `json:"problemCount,omitempty"`
	Type         EventMessageType `json:"type"`

	// WorkID A UUIDv7.
	WorkID  *ID   `json:"workId,omitempty"`
	WorkIds *[]ID `json:"workIds,omitempty"`
}

// EventMessageType defines model for EventMessage.Type.
type EventMessageType string

